    "text": "NOW THEREFORE, I, Maithripala Sirisena, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka reposinggreat trust and confidence in his prudence, ability and fidelity, do, in pursuance of the provisions of Section 3 of the Commissionsof Inquiry Act, by these presents appoint Wickum Athula Kaluarachchi Esquire, Judge of the High Court to be a Commissionerof the Commission of Inquiry constituted in terms of the Warrant referred to above :",
